# SYNTHETIC fixture. Not a captured sweep.
# Hand-built because no endpoint in the registry holds more than 200
# classes, so sw:sampleTruncated true cannot be captured live. The size
# limit that triggers truncation lives in the prober, not in this graph:
# only the sample's size and its sampleTruncated flag are asserted here, so
# a small truncated sample (3 values) is perfectly coherent on its own.
# Exists to make 'a truncated sample must be reported as truncated'
# testable: an implementation that hardcodes truncated = False passes
# every other test in this plan without this fixture.
